PROJECT: Aptos

## 2021

### EV-001
## Date
2021-02
## Event Name
Pendirian Aptos Labs
## Event Type
Founding
## Description
Mo Shaikh dan Avery Ching mendirikan Aptos Labs setelah Meta (Facebook) menghentikan proyek Diem. Keduanya membawa tim inti insinyur Diem untuk membangun blockchain Layer 1 baru berbasis Move.
## Participants
Mo Shaikh; Avery Ching; Aptos Labs Inc.
## Location
Palo Alto, California, United States
## Status
Completed
## Immediate Result
Terbentuknya entitas hukum Aptos Labs Inc. di Delaware untuk pengembangan protokol Aptos.
## Sources
- Sumber: Fortune Interview, https://fortune.com/2022/03/30/aptos-labs-mo-shaikh-avery-ching-diem-meta-crypto/ (HIGH)
- Sumber: Aptos Labs About, https://aptoslabs.com/about (HIGH)

## 2022

### EV-002
## Date
2022-03-21
## Event Name
Pengumuman Pembiayaan Series A
## Event Type
Funding
## Description
Aptos Labs mengumpulkan $200 juta dalam ronde Series A yang dipimpin Andreessen Horowitz (a16z) dengan partisipasi Multicoin Capital, Binance Labs, Coinbase Ventures, Dragonfly Capital, FTX Ventures, dan investor lain.
## Participants
Aptos Labs Inc.; Andreessen Horowitz (a16z); Multicoin Capital; Binance Labs; Coinbase Ventures; Dragonfly Capital; FTX Ventures
## Location
Palo Alto, California, United States
## Status
Completed
## Immediate Result
Valuasi Aptos Labs mencapai $1 miliar (unicorn) sebelum mainnet launch; dana digunakan untuk ekspansi tim dan ekosistem.
## Sources
- Sumber: Aptos Blog Series A, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-labs-raises-200-million-series-a (HIGH)
- Sumber: The Block, https://www.theblock.co/post/138882/aptos-labs-raises-200-million (HIGH)

